      ],
      "explanation": "We require \\(m^2-m=2\\), or \\((m-2)(m+1)=0\\), giving \\(m=2\\) or \\(m=-1\\). Also, the coefficient of the quadratic term must satisfy \\(m+1\\ne0\\), so \\(m\\ne-1\\). Therefore, \\(m=2\\).",
